/T (This project implements a simulator for three replacement algorithms: FIFO, LRU and Optimal. The user enters a reference string and a number of frames at run time. The program runs all three algorithms on the same input, prints a step-by-step trace for each, and finishes with a comparison of page faults, hits, hit ratio and fault ratio.)
/E (This project implements a simulator for three replacement algorithms: FIFO, LRU and Optimal. The user enters a reference string and a number of frames at run time. The program runs all three algorithms on the same input, prints a step-by-step trace for each, and finishes with a comparison of page faults, hits, hit ratio and fault ratio.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
