/P 50 0 R
/T (A single function, simulate\(\), implements all three policies; only the victim-selection rule differs. FIFO takes the front of a queue of arrival order, LRU takes the resident page with the smallest last-used index, and Optimal takes the resident page whose next use is farthest away \(ties go to the first page in the frames\). Each trace row is a dictionary with the keys step, page, frames, result \(H or F\) and replaced \(the evicted page, or -\). Hit ratio is hits / n and fault ratio is faults / n, where n is the length of the reference string.)
/E (A single function, simulate\(\), implements all three policies; only the victim-selection rule differs. FIFO takes the front of a queue of arrival order, LRU takes the resident page with the smallest last-used index, and Optimal takes the resident page whose next use is farthest away \(ties go to the first page in the frames\). Each trace row is a dictionary with the keys step, page, frames, result \(H or F\) and replaced \(the evicted page, or -\). Hit ratio is hits / n and fault ratio is faults / n, where n is the length of the reference string.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
