/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
421 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 54 0 R
/T (record the recency of every memory access. This needs a hardware counter or timestamp per page, or a stack or linked list of pages updated on each reference. Systems often use approximations such as reference bits, aging or the Clock algorithm. FIFO only needs a queue updated when a page is loaded.)
/E (record the recency of every memory access. This needs a hardware counter or timestamp per page, or a stack or linked list of pages updated on each reference. Systems often use approximations such as reference bits, aging or the Clock algorithm. FIFO only needs a queue updated when a page is loaded.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
