462 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 55 0 R
/T (The simulator implements FIFO, LRU and Optimal page replacement with validated user input, step-by-step traces and a comparison table. The experiments confirmed that Optimal gives the fewest faults, that LRU generally beats FIFO but not on every input, and that FIFO exhibits Belady's anomaly while the stack algorithms LRU and Optimal do not. The project helped in understanding how the choice of victim page affects the number of page faults and why practical systems approximate LRU.)
/E (The simulator implements FIFO, LRU and Optimal page replacement with validated user input, step-by-step traces and a comparison table. The experiments confirmed that Optimal gives the fewest faults, that LRU generally beats FIFO but not on every input, and that FIFO exhibits Belady's anomaly while the stack algorithms LRU and Optimal do not. The project helped in understanding how the choice of victim page affects the number of page faults and why practical systems approximate LRU.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
463 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 55 0 R
