774 0 obj
<<
/Title (reference string, the set of pages in memory with n frames is always a subset of the set in memory with n+1 frames \(the inclusion or stack property\). So an extra frame can only keep more useful pages and can never cause an extra fault. FIFO chooses victims by arrival order rather than usefulness, so it has no such property.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 683 0 R
/Prev 831 0 R
>>
endobj
775 0 obj
