869 0 obj
<<
/Title (record the recency of every memory access. This needs a hardware counter or timestamp per page, or a stack or linked list of pages updated on each reference. Systems often use approximations such as reference bits, aging or the Clock algorithm. FIFO only needs a queue updated when a page is loaded.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 778 0 R
/Prev 906 0 R
/Next 837 0 R
>>
endobj
870 0 obj
<<
